# Byte-stable hashes for this base on every platform.
#
# world-build.json and the release asset manifest pin a SHA-256 per file, so a
# checkout must produce the same bytes on Windows and Unix. Without this file
# core.autocrlf=true would rewrite every text file to CRLF and every pinned hash
# would fail after a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
